SUMMARY:Smoky Mountains Wilderness Watch Chapter Meeting (Waynesville)
DESCRIPTION:Are you passionate about wildlife? Do you want to make a difference for natural resource management\, protection\, and enjoyment? Smoky Mountains Wilderness Watch is a new chapter of the North Carolina Wildlife Federation. The chapter’s mission is to rewild\, protect\, and conserve habitat creating a more livable landscape for humans and wildlife. \nJoin chapter leaders at Smoky Mountain Dog Bar in Waynesville to learn more about the chapter\, receive updates on chapter progress\, and discover different ways to get involved. All are welcome! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/smoky-mountains-wilderness-watch-chapter-meeting-waynesville-2/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/smoky-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
