SUMMARY:Brumley Oasis Watering Workday (Chapel Hill)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Tri-County Conservationists Chapter for an oasis maintenance workday! The chapter worked hard to plant and fence 8 native plant oases in Brumley Preserve South. Now comes the important work of stewarding and maintaining the native saplings in these oases. Join us to water these saplings and help them through the drought! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/brumley-oasis-watering-workday-chapel-hill/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
